    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Spell Wizard</strong>, you\u2019ll battle hordes of enemies by typing the words associated with them to unleash spells. Precision and speed are your weapons in this fast-paced Typing game with Roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Typing Combat:</strong> Face off against waves of enemies, using your keyboard to strike them down with precision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/e813449b332ef8bac56748e552600e17.poster.avif?t=1752589881\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/e813449b332ef8bac56748e552600e17.webm?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/e813449b332ef8bac56748e552600e17.mp4?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Collect gems to enhance your abilities and unlock new upgrades between runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/0852734e240bfb6690ebbdd93268f583.poster.avif?t=1752589881\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/0852734e240bfb6690ebbdd93268f583.webm?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/0852734e240bfb6690ebbdd93268f583.mp4?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Intense:</strong> Each run is a  test of skill and survival, perfect for quick gaming sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/c1565eecd6cdb4266b936171f7ed01ed.poster.avif?t=1752589881\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/c1565eecd6cdb4266b936171f7ed01ed.webm?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/c1565eecd6cdb4266b936171f7ed01ed.mp4?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Driven Gameplay:</strong> A game for every skill level\u2014develop your typing mastery and rise above the horde.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/a0cc5a1ed3b13864914d073a8474b581.poster.avif?t=1752589881\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/a0cc5a1ed3b13864914d073a8474b581.webm?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389700/extras/a0cc5a1ed3b13864914d073a8474b581.mp4?t=1752589881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
